OL,3,AWhy the US midterms sparked an AI stock
OL,4,Aselloff
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt followed sweeping gains by the
OL,7,FDemocrats in this week's midterm
OL,8,Felections in the US, which have given
OL,9,Fthe party full control of Congress.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/19
